{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","永恒梦境"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤梦境催眠所有敌人，使其每秒受到伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤梦境持续3.5 + 0.5秒，使所有敌人进入“催眠”状态，被“催眠”的目标无法行动且每秒受到70% + 12% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","被“催眠”的目标每秒受到伤害提升至80% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","被“催眠”的目标每秒受到伤害提升至90% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","被“催眠”的目标每秒受到伤害提升至100% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","被“催眠”的目标每秒受到伤害提升至110% + 12% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","梦灵化身"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","消耗生命值对周围敌人造成伤害和眩晕，并飞向远处敌人再次造成伤害和眩晕。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","消耗自身当前10%生命值，对自身周围1格范围内的所有敌人造成相当于消耗生命值110% + 10%的伤害并使其眩晕0.5秒（伤害量不低于60% ATK），随后飞向距离最远的敌人身边再次对自身周围1格范围内的敌人施加该效果，单次技能对同一名敌人造成的第二次伤害只造成原伤害量的50%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至生命消耗量的120% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至生命消耗量的130% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至生命消耗量的140% + 10%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","蝶梦穿梭"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","每当损失一定生命值后化为“梦蝶”，持续恢复生命并对周围敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当自身累计失去50% HP生命值后，躲入梦境变为“梦蝶”形态。“梦蝶”形态下自身处于无敌状态，每秒恢复120% + 10% ATK生命值并对周围1格范围内的敌人造成45% + 5% ATK伤害，持续3秒。本技能在同一场战斗中最多释放2次。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":86,"end":91,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":43,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"},{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":83,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“梦蝶”形态下每秒造成伤害提高至50% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“梦蝶”形态下每秒造成伤害提高至55% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“梦蝶”形态下每秒造成伤害提高至60% + 5% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，终极技能持续期间进一步提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升9%。释放“永恒梦境”后，在梦境持续时间内额外提升6%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。释放“永恒梦境”后，在梦境持续时间内额外提升8%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升15%。释放“永恒梦境”后，在梦境持续时间内额外提升10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","璀璨鳞粉"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能后获得急速并且受到伤害减少，并能更快释放技能“梦灵化身”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塔西在释放终极技能“永恒梦境”后的5秒内，获得70点急速并且受到伤害减少90%，使用技能“梦灵化身”不受冷却时间限制，并且不再消耗生命值（造成伤害时视为消耗了10%当前生命值），并且会优先选择距离最远的处于“催眠”状态的敌人释放。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","塔西释放终极技能“永恒梦境”后获得急速提高至100点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","技能“梦灵化身”对处于“催眠”状态的敌人造成伤害时附带40点穿透。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","塔西释放终极技能“永恒梦境”后获得急速提高至130点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","塔西每次参与击败敌方英雄额外获得一次“蝶梦穿梭”的释放次数。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","塔西每次参与击败敌方非召唤物角色后，额外获得一次“蝶梦穿梭”的释放次数。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":4,"end":8,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","梦行灵环"]]}